param([Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$PackageDirectory,[string]$BackendUrl="https://localhost:8080/",[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$PolicySigningPublicKey,[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$PolicySigningKeyId)
$ErrorActionPreference='Stop';$target=Join-Path $env:ProgramFiles 'GManager Client';New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force $target|Out-Null;Copy-Item (Join-Path $PackageDirectory 'service') $target -Recurse -Force;Copy-Item (Join-Path $PackageDirectory 'shell') $target -Recurse -Force
$settings=Get-Content (Join-Path $target 'service\appsettings.json') -Raw|ConvertFrom-Json;$settings.Backend.BaseUrl=$BackendUrl;$settings.Policy.SigningPublicKey=$PolicySigningPublicKey;$settings.Policy.SigningKeyId=$PolicySigningKeyId;$settings|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 5|Set-Content (Join-Path $target 'service\appsettings.json') -Encoding utf8
$state=Join-Path $env:ProgramData 'GManager\Client';New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force $state|Out-Null;icacls $state /inheritance:r /grant:r '*S-1-5-18:(OI)(CI)F' '*S-1-5-32-544:(OI)(CI)F'|Out-Null
sc.exe create GManagerClient binPath= "`"$target\service\GManager.Client.Service.exe`"" start= auto DisplayName= "G-Manager Gaming Client";sc.exe failure GManagerClient reset= 86400 actions= restart/5000/restart/15000/restart/60000
$action=New-ScheduledTaskAction -Execute (Join-Path $target 'shell\GManager.Client.Shell.exe');$trigger=New-ScheduledTaskTrigger -AtLogOn;Register-ScheduledTask -TaskName 'GManagerClientShell' -Action $action -Trigger $trigger -Description 'G-Manager fullscreen station shell' -Force|Out-Null;sc.exe start GManagerClient
